<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2CO" style="id">2 WAKO-Kami Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">Wakolinto</para>
  <para style="toc1">Usenga wa Mulungu kama vuwandikigwe kwa Wakolinto</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Wakolinto</para>
  <para style="toc3">2Wako</para>
  <para style="mt2">Usenga wa Mulungu kama vuwandikigwe na</para>
  <para style="mt1">Wakolinto</para>
  <para style="imt">Ulongozi</para>
  <para style="ip">Usenga wa 2 Wakolinto wandikgwa na msenga Paulo behi na milao ya 55 mbaka 56 viyavumbuke Kilisito muisula 1:1. Ino ni balua ya kaidi mwa zija balua mbili chilinazo zija yazandike Paulo kwa bumbila da wamtogole Kilisito wa uko Kolinto. Weli na ilimu wotogola kua baho haumwanduso Paulo kandika balua igangamale kwa wakolinto. Chabule nakala yake yoyose ya balua ino ija yoilagusa muisula ya 2:3-4. 2 Wakolinto wandikigwa haja Paulo viyakalile kuja Makedonia muisula 2:13. Usenga uli muibalua ya 2 Wakolinto ni usenga uiyeka uja wolagusa kua wa chiunhu ng'hani na wa kudumbiza. Paulo kolongelela deng'o jake kwambuli ya uja usenga unogile yaubokele kulawa kwa Tito uja wolongelela mbuli ya bumbila da wamtogole Kilisito wa uko Kolinto. Muibalua ino, chipata mafundo gagangamale gaja golawa mgamafundo ga chitabu cha lagano da sambi, haja Paulo viyalavile malagizo ga kuzambwila sente ili zisoligwe na kuwataza waja womtogola Mulungu wa uko Yelusalem muisula 8-9. Yooneka kua Walagusi wamwenga wa uvwizi kulawa kunze mdibumbila da wamtogole Kilisito wakala wotumila ubananzi wa wanhu wamwenga mdibumbila da wamtogole Kilisito waisang'hanile viwolonda kumbanga Paulo. Wakala wodumba kwa mbuli ya ukulu wa Paulo, uja umtendile iyo kugangamala na ukulu kamavija uja wa mlagusi Yesu Kilisito kubitila muukomelezo wa 2 Wakolinto.</para>
  <para style="iot">Galiumo</para>
  <para style="io">1. Paulo muibalua yake kasonga kuwalamusa bumbila da wamtogole Kilisito muisula 1:1-7.</para>
  <para style="io">2. Lonzi zimwenga za Paulo kwambuli ya kuhindula kuita mmwanza wake na usenga yaubokele kwambuli yao na vija viwaubokele mui balua ija ilongole muisula 1:8-7-16.</para>
  <para style="io">3. Badili ya gago, Paulo kalava malagizo ga kuzambwila sente kwambuli ya wamtogole Kilisito wa uko Yelusalem 8:1-9-15.</para>
  <para style="io">4. Hachikomelezo, Paulo kalava wimilizi muulagusi na kalava kalikilo kwambuli ya Mwanza wake umwenga 10:1-13-10</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2CO 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 1:1" />Niye Paulo, mtumigwa wa Kilisito Yesu kwa wende wa Mulungu, hamwe na miangu Timoseo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CO 1:1">Chomwandikileni mweye mli mdibumbila da wamtogole Kilisito mli uko Kolinto, na wanhu wose wa Mulungu hohose hamwili hai isi ya Akaya.<verse eid="2CO 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 1:2" />Chompulileni utindiwala na unovu kulawa kwa Mulungu Tata yetu na Mndewa wetu Yesu Kilisito ukale na mweye.<verse eid="2CO 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulo kamwing'ha hewela Mulungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 1:3" />Yatogoligwe Mulungu na Tata wa Mndewa wetu Yesu Kilisito, Tata yeli na bazi na Mulungu yoching'ha deng'o jose. <verse eid="2CO 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 1:4" />Nayo koching'ha deng'o mgamadununzo getu gose, ili na cheye ivija chiweng'he deng'o wamwenga mgamadununzo gao gose kwa deng'o idija ichidibokela kulawa kwa Mulungu. <verse eid="2CO 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 1:5" />Enaa, kama vichigendelela ku bokela madununzo kwambuli ya kumtogola Kilisito, ivo ivija vichigendelela kubokela deng'o jake. <verse eid="2CO 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 1:6" />Yahawa chodununzika, ni kwambuli ya deng'o na ulohozi wenu, hebu chiheng'higwa deng'o ni kwambuli yakuwatenda mgafunyile moyo madununzo igaja gachibokela cheye. <verse eid="2CO 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 1:7" />Kaidi tamanilo dichilinajo kwambuli yenu digangamala, chovimanya kua mwahailumba mga madununzo getu, ivija muilumba mdi deng'o jetu.<verse eid="2CO 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 1:8" />Mbwiga zangu, cholonda mvimanye madununzo gachipatile kuja muikae ya Asia gakala gachizamila ng'hani mbaka tamanilo da kua na ugima disegela. <verse eid="2CO 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 1:9" />Enaa chikala kama wanhu wobeta ifa, ili chifundigwe kumtumanila Mulungu ija yowazilibula wafile, badili ya kutumanila ludabwa lwetu wenyego. <verse eid="2CO 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 1:10" />Kulawa muing'ondo iyo ng'hulu ya ifa, nayo kachilohola na ivija chomtumanila kua kokwiza kochilohola kaidi, <verse eid="2CO 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 1:11" />na mweye mwahailumba na cheye kwambuli ya kuchipulila kwa Mulungu. Baho wanhu wengi womwing'ha hewela Mulungu kwambuli yetu.<verse eid="2CO 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulo kohindula mwanza wake</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 1:12" />Cheye choigodela chinhu chimwe, kugesa kwetu kochilagusila ugima wetu muiisi ino, na hasa kuilumba kwetu na mweye hachilongozigwe na nzewele ya chiunhu, mbali kwa unovu wa Mulungu.<verse eid="2CO 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 1:13" />Chowandikileni mweye mbuli zimdaha kuzisoma na kuzimanya. Mbali hata yahawa movimanya chidogo, notumanila kua mokwiza kuvimanya goya, <verse eid="2CO 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 1:14" />kwavija mbaka sambi mochimanya cheye chidogo tu. Chovimanya kua mdizua dija da kubwela kaidi Mndewa Yesu modaha kuigodela cheye na cheye ivija kuigodela mweye.<verse eid="2CO 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 1:15" />Nihawa na matamanilo gago, nilonda kwiza kumwenu baho haumwanduso ili mbokele kaidi ganogile mengi ga Mulungu. <verse eid="2CO 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 1:16" />Nilonda kubitila hamwenu nihawa muumwanza kuita Makedonia na chipindi cha kubwela ivija, ili mhate kutazigwa na mweye muumwanza wangu wa kuita uko Yudea. <verse eid="2CO 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 1:17" />Vinilondile kusang'hana vino, ivo mogesa kama niye munhu nilibule ulamuzi? Hebu mogesa kua nosang'hana vinilonda niye kama notonga chiunhu na kua nolonga,“Enaa.” na “Habule“ baho kwa baho? <verse eid="2CO 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 1:18" />Mulungu iyo ukweli uiyeka, baho chija ichiniwalongeleni mweye si mbuli ya “Enaa.” hebu “Habule.” <verse eid="2CO 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 1:19" />Kilisito Yesu, mwana wa Mulungu, ija niye Siliwano na miangu Timoseo, chimligula kumwenu na hawile munhu wa “Enaa.” na “Habule“ ila iyo mmazua gose ni “Enaa.” ya Mulungu. <verse eid="2CO 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 1:20" />Kwavija mgati yake malaliko gose ga Mulungu gakala “Enaa.” Kwambuli iyo,”Pepa.” yetu yolongigwa kwambuli ya Kilisito kwa kumwing'ha hewela Mulungu. <verse eid="2CO 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 1:21" />Mulungu mwenyego iyo kochigangamiza cheye na mweye kwa kuilumba na Kilisito, na Mulungu mweyego iyo yachisagule, <verse eid="2CO 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CO 1:22" />iyo yochigela chilaguso cha kua wanhu wake na kuching'ha muhe wake mmioyo yetu ili kuchigangamizila kwa mbuli zose zija ziyachilalike.<verse eid="2CO 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CO 1:23" />Mulungu iyo mlongezi wangu, iyo koumanya moyo wangu kua nolonga kweli! Niye kwa kuwaonela bazi baho sibwelile uko Kolinto.<verse eid="2CO 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CO 1:24" />Hachilonda kuwaswangiza kwambuli ya kutogola kwenu, cheye chovimanya kua mweye mgangamala kwa kutogola Mulungu. Cheye cholondeka kusang'hana hamwe kwambuli ya deng'o jenu.<verse eid="2CO 1:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2CO 2" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 2:1" />Baho, nilonda sekenibwele kumwenu kaidi kuwagela giogio. <verse eid="2CO 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 2:2" />Nilonda ivo kwavija nihaweng'heni mweye giogio, baho yelihi yonda yaning'he deng'o? Iwaja niweng'ile giogio. <verse eid="2CO 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 2:3" />Iyo mbuli nimwandikileni, silondile kwiza kumwenu ili sekemning'he giogio, kwavija mweye iyo molondeka kuning'ha deng'o. Niye nivimanya kweli kua nihadeng'helela na mweye mose ivija modeng'helela.<verse eid="2CO 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 2:4" />Haichanduso nimwandikileni nili mdigiogio na kulumila mmoyo wangu na mahozi mengi ganilawa, haiwile kwa mbuli ya kuweng'ha mweye giogio, ila kwa mbuli ya kuwalagusileni kua nina wende ng'hani na mweye.<verse eid="2CO 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kumlekesela yeli na ubananzi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 2:5" />Ihawa hana munhu yoyose kamtenda munhu imwe yawe na giogio, hanhendele niye, mbali kamwing'hani giogio mweye mose na ivo silonda kua mbwakilaji ng'hani.<verse eid="2CO 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 2:6" />Viyenukiligwe na wengi kulawa mmwenu imala. <verse eid="2CO 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 2:7" />Chisigale mmwenu, molondeka kumlekesela na kumgela moyo ili sekeyawe na giogio ng'hani na kuleka kugendelela. <verse eid="2CO 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 2:8" />Kwaivo, nompulani mulagusileni kaidi kua mna wende nayo. <verse eid="2CO 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 2:9" />Chinigesile kwandika balua ija nilonda kuvimanya kama mkala tiyali kunhegeleza chila chinilonga.<verse eid="2CO 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 2:10" />Mwahamlekesela munhu na niye nomlekesela. Kwavija nihamlekesela munhu, kama nahawa na mbuli ya kumlekesela, nomlekesela ha meso ha Kilisito kwa mbuli yenu, <verse eid="2CO 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 2:11" />ili sekechimleke Mwenembago kuchivwizila, kwavija chovimanya vija mbuli zake vizili.<verse eid="2CO 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulo muikae ya Tiloa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 2:12" />Baho vinivikile uko Tiloa kuligula Usenga Unogile wa Kilisito, nivika Mndewa kaitanda nzila nisang'hane sang'hano yake. <verse eid="2CO 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 2:13" />Mbali nigwa giogio ng'hani kwavija simvikile mbwiga yangu Tito. Baho niwalaga wose haja na kusegela kuita Makedonia.<verse eid="2CO 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuhuma kwa kutazigwa na Kilisito</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 2:14" />Mbali nomwing'ha hewela Mulungu yochilongoza mazua gose galibule uhelelo muumwanza wa kuilumba na Kilisito. Iyo yochitenda chiuligule ukweli wa Kilisito kama chinhung'ila vichinugila goya chila hanu.<verse eid="2CO 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 2:15" />Kwavija cheye ni kama chinung'ila goya cha ubani chija Kilisito chiyamlavila Mulungu, chinung'ila goya chiwavikila wose, waja woloholigwa na waja wokwaga.<verse eid="2CO 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 2:16" />Kwa waja wokwaga, chinung'ila icho ni ifa, mbali kwa waja woloholigwa chinung'ila icho ni ugima. Yelihi baho yodaha kusang'hana sang'hano ya kulinga ivo? <verse eid="2CO 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 2:17" />Cheye si kama wanhu wamwenga waja wogula usenga wa Mulungu, mbali kwavija cheye chitumigwa kuligula kwa nzila ilondeka na Mulungu, kama watumigwa wa Mulungu kuno chiilumba na Kilisito.<verse eid="2CO 2:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2CO 3" />
  <para style="s">Watumigwa wa Lagano da Sambi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 3:1" />Ivo, chosonga kaidi kuilondela nhogolwa wenyego? Ivo, cholonda balua ya kutambuligwa kwiza kumwenu, hebu kulawa kumwenu kwiza kumwetu kama wanhu wamwenga? <verse eid="2CO 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 3:2" />Mweye wenyego ni balua yetu, balua yandikigwe mmioyo yetu ili chila munhu yaimanye na kuisoma. <verse eid="2CO 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 3:3" />Ni kweli kua mweye mwa balua ya Kilisito yaigalile kwa makono getu. Balua yenyego haiyandikigwe kwa wino, bali kwa Muhe wa Mulungu yeli na ugima, hayandikigwe mchihande cha dibwe mbali mmioyo ya wanhu.<verse eid="2CO 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 3:4" />Cholonga vino kwambuli ya tamanilo jetu chilinajo kwa Mulungu kubitila gaja yachitendele Kilisito.<verse eid="2CO 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 3:5" />Sio kwavija cheye chodaha kusang'hana chochose kwa udaho wetu wenyego, mbali udaho chilinao wolawa kwa Mulungu. <verse eid="2CO 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 3:6" />Mulungu iyo yachidahize kudisang'hanila Lagano da Sambi dija si Lagano da ndagizi yandikigwe, bali Lagano da Muhe wa Mulungu. Kwavija ndagizi yandikigwe yogala ifa, mbali Muhe wa Mulungu kogala ugima.<verse eid="2CO 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 3:7" />Ndagizi za Musa ikigwa kwa kwandikigwa mvihande va mabwe. Hata ihawa hachikomezo ilawila ifa, ukulu wake ukala mwingi ng'hani na chihanga cha Musa chikala chobalika ng'hani mbaka wana wa Izilaeli wapotigwa kuchilola. Kaidi kubalika uko kukala kwa chipindi chiguhi tu. Baho yahawa sang'hano ya chija chigalile ifa chitendeka kwa ukulu mwingi kulinga ivo, <verse eid="2CO 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 3:8" />baho sang'hano ya Muhe wa Mulungu kana ukulu mwingi ng'hani!<verse eid="2CO 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 3:9" />Baho, kukala na ukulu mdisang'hano iyo igalile kulamuligwa, ni kweli kua sang'hano igala kutogoligwa yokua na ukulu mwingi ng'hani ugala ulohozi! <verse eid="2CO 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 3:10" />Baho ukulu wa lagano da mwaka uhalawa kwavija ukulu wa lagano da sambi uvika, uja mkulu ng'hani. <verse eid="2CO 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 3:11" />Yahawa chija chikalile cha chipindi chiguhi tu, chikala na ukulu wake, ukweli chija chokala mazua gose, chokua na ukulu mkulu ng'hani.<verse eid="2CO 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 3:12" />Baho kwavija dino ijo tumanilo jetu, cholonga bila kudumba. <verse eid="2CO 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 3:13" />Cheye hachitenda kama Musa ija yagubike chihanga chake kwa chitambala ili wanhu wa Izilaeli sekewauone uja ukomelezo wa ubung'hulo uja ukalile womala kubung'hula.<verse eid="2CO 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 3:14" />Mbali umanyi wao ukala ugeligwa ubozi, mbaka vino sambi chila dihasomigwa Lagano da mwaka chigubiko cha chitambala icho ching'hali baho. Chigubiko icho chosegezigwa tu munhu yahailumba na Kilisito. <verse eid="2CO 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 3:15" />Kwaivo mbaka vino lelo, chila vichisoma ndagizi za Musa umanyi wao wokuwa ugubikigwa. <verse eid="2CO 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 3:16" />Mayandiko ga Mulungu golonga kwambuli ya Musa, munhu yahamuhindukila Mndewa Mulungu, chigubiko icho chosegezigwa. <verse eid="2CO 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 3:17" />Baho, “Mndewa.” ni Muhe wa Mulungu, na haja hayeli Muhe wa Mndewa baho hana kuilegeha. <verse eid="2CO 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 3:18" />Baho cheye chose waja vihanga vetu havigubikigwe choona kama mchilole, ukulu wa Mndewa, chohinduligwa chiilinge ng'hani na uwo mfano wake kulawa ukulu mbaka ukulu mwingi ng'hani. Iyo ni sang'hano yake Muhe wa Mndewa.<verse eid="2CO 3:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="2CO 4" />
  <para style="s">Kwika Muhe wa Mulungu mvinongo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 4:1" />Baho, Mulungu kwa bazi jake kaching'ha sang'hano ino na ivo hachifa moyo. <verse eid="2CO 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 4:2" />Chizileka mbuli zose za chinyala na za mchifiso, hachikala kaidi kwa uvwizi hebu kwa kuwagiza usenga wa Mulungu, ila kwa kuilonga ija kweli kwa kutogola wenyego kwa kulongozigwa na wanhu haulongozi ha Mulungu.<verse eid="2CO 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 4:3" />Kwavija, kama uno Usenga Unogile chiuligula uifisa, baho uifisa kwa waja wokwaga tu. <verse eid="2CO 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 4:4" />Wao hawatogola kwavija ija Mwenembago mlongoza isi ino kaugela ziza umanyi wao sekewaone hazelu bung'hulo da Usenga Unogile wa ukulu wa Kilisito, uja mfano wenele wa Mulungu. <verse eid="2CO 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 4:5" />Kwavija hachiiligulila wenyego, ila chomligula Yesu Kilisito kama Mndewa, na cheye wenyego chokua watumigwa wenu kwambuli yake.<verse eid="2CO 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 4:6" />Mulungu ija yalongile, “Bung'hulo na dibung'hule mdiziza!” Iyo yoibung'hulila mioyo yetu, na kuching'ha bung'hulo da umanyi wa ukulu wake wobung'hula mchihanga cha Kilisito.<verse eid="2CO 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 4:7" />Baho cheye chili na Muhe wa Mulungu uno, chabaha kama via va ulongo vija vitulika tu, ili iyoneke hazelu kua udaho uwo mkulu wolawa kwa Mulungu, wala haulawa kumwetu cheye. <verse eid="2CO 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 4:8" />Mala nyingi chodununzika, mbali hawachionela, chopotigwa kutogola mbali chogendelela, <verse eid="2CO 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 4:9" />chodununzika mbali Mulungu haleka kuchitaza, hata kama chibwanhigwa hasi mbali chikala ching'hali chigangamale. <verse eid="2CO 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 4:10" />Mazua gose chikala muibung'hukila kama viyakomigwe Kilisito, ili ugima wake Yesu ivija uwoneke mzing'huli zetu. <verse eid="2CO 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 4:11" />Enaa, mazua gose ga ugima wetu chigubikigwa na ifa ya Yesu, ili ugima wake uwoneke mzing'huli zetu zidanganika. <verse eid="2CO 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 4:12" />Ino yooneka kua mazua gose chodununzika na kua behi na kudanganika, na ivo mweye mobokela ugima.<verse eid="2CO 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 4:13" />Mayandiko ga Mulungu golonga, “Nimtogola Mulungu iyo maana nilonga.” Nacheye ivija chili na moyo uuja wa kutogola, cholonga kwavija chotogola. <verse eid="2CO 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 4:14" />Chovimanya kua ija yamzilibule Mndewa Yesu kokwiza kuchizilibula na cheye ivija kuilumba na Yesu na kuchika haulongozi hake hamwe na mweye. <verse eid="2CO 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 4:15" />Gose gano ni kwambuli yenu, hata unovu wa Mulungu wowavikila wanhu wengi ng'hani, na hewela nazo zongezeke ng'hani kwa ukulu wa Mulungu.<verse eid="2CO 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kukala kwa kumtogola Mulungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 4:16" />Kwambuli ino hachifa moyo, hata kama ng'huli zetu zolala na kubanangika, mbali mgati chotendigwa wa sambi chila zua.<verse eid="2CO 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 4:17" />Kugaya kuchipata ni kudodo, kaidi ni kwa chipindi tu, mbali yoching'ha ukulu kubita gaja matamanilo gose na uja ukulu wake ni mkulu ng'hani kubita madununzo. <verse eid="2CO 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 4:18" />Baho chobeta kwa kulolela si kwa vinhu tu vioneka ila vija havioneka. Kwavija vija vioneka ni va chipindi tu, mbali vija havioneka ni va mazua gose galibule uhelelo.<verse eid="2CO 4:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="2CO 5" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 5:1" />Kwaivo chovimanya kua chiheha chino ichikala hano muiisi yani ng'huli zetu kama chiheha chobomoligwa, Mulungu koching'ha ukazi umwenga uko kuulanga kwa Mulungu, ng'anda yaizengile mwenyego iyo haibanangika mazua gose. <verse eid="2CO 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 5:2" />Na sambi vichikala hano muiisi, chogutilila kuno chololela kwa tamanilo kulu na kwing'higwa ukazi wetu uli kuulanga kwa Mulungu, <verse eid="2CO 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 5:3" />enaa, cholondeka kuvazigwa kama ivo ili seke chime haulongozi ha Mulungu bila chivalo. <verse eid="2CO 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 5:4" />Chahawa ching'hali mchiheha cha muuisi, chogutilila kwa mbuli nyingi zichidununza, si kwavija chonda kuuvula lukuli uno wa ifa, ila china tamanilo da kuvazigwa ugima uja haufa, ili chija chifa chimeligwe kabisa na ugima. <verse eid="2CO 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 5:5" />Mulungu mwenyego iyo yachitandile kwambuli iyo, nayo kaching'ha Muhe wake ili uwe muamana kwa gaja gayachikile.<verse eid="2CO 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 5:6" />Kwaivo chima goya mazua gose. Chovimanya kua kukala mulukuli uno tu, baho ni kukala kutali na Mndewa. <verse eid="2CO 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 5:7" />Kwavija chokala kwa kutogola na si kwa gaja gachiona. <verse eid="2CO 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 5:8" />Mbali chima goya na maza vichilonda chiuleke lukuli luno na chihamile kwa Mndewa. <verse eid="2CO 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 5:9" />Mbali mbuli ifaya ng'hani cholonda kumlagusila wende iwe chokala muuisi hebu uko kuulanga kwa Mulungu. <verse eid="2CO 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 5:10" />Kwavija chose cholondeka chime haulongozi ha chigoda cha ulamuzi cha Kilisito chilamuligwe, ili chila munhu yabokele chija chiyalondeka kwambuli ya zisang'hane chipindi chiyakalile muuisi kuno yahawa katenda ganogile hebu gehile.<verse eid="2CO 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuilumba na Mulungu kwa nzila ya Kilisito</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 5:11" />Baho, cheye chovimanya viifaya kumfugamila Mndewa, ivo choiyoha kuwakema wanhu. Mulungu mwenyego kochimanya vinogile, na niye notumanila kua na mweye ivija mochimanya goya. <verse eid="2CO 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 5:12" />Si kua chogeza kaidi kuwatogoleni mweye ila cholonda kumwing'hani chija kichitenda chiigodele mweye, ili mdahe kuwalongela waja woigodela ng'huli zao vizili kubita vija viweli mmoyo. <verse eid="2CO 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 5:13" />Yahawa chooneka china chichala, iyo kwa mbuli ya Mulungu, na yahawa china umanyi wetu wenele, iyo ni kwambuli yenu. <verse eid="2CO 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 5:14" />Kwavija wende wa Kilisito wochilongoza, cheye chivimanyile kua munhu imwe tu kadanganika kwambuli ya wose, na iyo yolagusa kua wose wailumba muifa yake. <verse eid="2CO 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 5:15" />Kadanganika kwambuli ya wanhu wose, ili waja weli na ugima sekewakale kwa mbuli yao wenyego, mbali wakale kwambuli yake yadanganike, na kazilibuligwa kwambuli yao.<verse eid="2CO 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 5:16" />Kwaivo kulawa sambi, cheye hachimgeza munhu yoyose chiunhu. Hata yahawa chipindi chimwe chimgeza Kilisito chiunhu, mbali sambi hachitenda ivo kaidi. <verse eid="2CO 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 5:17" />Munhu yoyose yahailumba na Kilisito kokua chilumbe cha sambi, gaumwaka gabita, sambi kokua munhu wa sambi. <verse eid="2CO 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 5:18" />Zose ni sang'hano za Mulungu yochilumba cheye nayo kwa nzila ya Kilisito. Kaching'ha sang'hano da kuwalumba wanhu nayo. <verse eid="2CO 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 5:19" />Iyo kulonga Mulungu kakala yowalumba wanhu wa isi zose kwa nzila ya Kilisito, bila kugesa malozo ga wanhu wao. Iyo kaching'ha usenga wa kuwatenda wanhu wailumbe nayo.<verse eid="2CO 5:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 5:20" />Baho, cheye chawasenga wa mbuli za Kilisito, na Mulungu mwenyego kochitumila cheye chiwapule mwenye. Chino icho chiyalonda Kilisito chimpuleni mweye mchitende. <verse eid="2CO 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 5:21" />Kilisito hakalile na malozo, mbali Mulungu kamtenda yavale malozo kwambuli yetu, ili cheye kwa kuilumba nayo, chipate kuvala kutogoligwa na Mulungu.<verse eid="2CO 5:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="2CO 6" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 6:1" />Baho, chahawa wasang'hanaji hamwe na Mulungu, baho chompulani seke mtogole kuwagiza unovu umuubokele kulawa kwa Mulungu wage bule. <verse eid="2CO 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 6:2" />Mulungu kolonga vino,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2CO 6:2">“Chipindi chifaya nikutegeleza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2CO 6:2">nikutaza chipindi cha ulohozi.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CO 6:2">Ulole sambi icho chipindi chifaya, sambi ijo zua da ulohozi!<verse eid="2CO 6:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 6:3" />Hachilonda kumwikila ng'walo munhu kwa chochose ili sekechilaumigwe na yoyose muisang'hano yetu. <verse eid="2CO 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 6:4" />Badili yake choilagusa kweli kua watumigwa wa Mulungu kwa chila chinhu. Kwa kufunya moyo ng'hani chipindi cha madununzo, udala na kugaya. <verse eid="2CO 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 6:5" />Chitoigwa na chigeliwa mdigeleza na chizomeligwa hazelu, chisang'hana sang'hano chilegela, chiwasa meso na kusinda nzala.<verse eid="2CO 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 6:6" />Choilagusa kua watumigwa wa Mulungu kwambuli ya moyo unang'hane na umanyi na kufunya moyo na kutogoliwa, kwa Muhe wa Mulungu, kwambuli ya wende ulibule ubilikizi, <verse eid="2CO 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 6:7" />kwa usenga wa kweli na kwa udaho wa Mulungu. Kutogoligwa ni gwamo na mgoha wetu wa chila ubanzi, kutoa na kuikimila. <verse eid="2CO 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 6:8" />Cheye chomsang'hanila Mulungu, chotogola kutegelezigwa hebu kuzeleuligwa, kulaumigwa hebu kwing'higwa nhogolwa. Wochitonga kua wavwizi, kumbe cholonga kweli, <verse eid="2CO 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 6:9" />kama hachimanyika, kumbe kwa wose chomanyika, kama wanhu chidanganike, mbali kama vumchiona cheye chawagima kabisa. Hata yahawa chitoigwa, mbali ching'hali na ugima, <verse eid="2CO 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 6:10" />hata yahawa chooneka chigeligwa giogio ila chodeng'helela mazua gose, hata chahawa chooneka vikumbi muyega, chowatenda wanhu wengi kua wazenzi, chooneka chabule chinhu chochose kumbe china chila chinhu.<verse eid="2CO 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 6:11" />Mbwiga zetu Wakolinto! Chilonga na mweye hazelu, na mioyo yetu yabule fundogolo. <verse eid="2CO 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 6:12" />Kama moona hana ng'walo yoyose ija, ng'walo iyo ya ubanzi wenu wenyego, na si kwa ubanzi wetu. <verse eid="2CO 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 6:13" />Sambi nolonga na mweye mwahawa wanangu, ikeni mbuli zenu hazelu, kama cheye vichitenda!<verse eid="2CO 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuwalakila wanhu waja hawamtogola Mulungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 6:14" />Sekemuilumbe hamwe na wanhu hawamtogola Mulungu, kwa ijo hadidahika. Ivo unovu na ubananzi voilumba kweli? Ivo, bung'hulo na ziza vodahikaze kukala hamwe? <verse eid="2CO 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 6:15" />Kilisito kodahaze kuilumba na Mwenembago? Mtogola Mulungu kana ubwiga ulihi na ija homtogola Mulungu? <verse eid="2CO 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 6:16" />ng'anda ya Mulungu yoilumbaze na milungu nyang'iti? Kwavija cheye iyo ng'anda ya Mulungu yeli na ugima. Kama Mulungu mwenyego viyalongile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2CO 6:16">“Nokwiza kwika ukazi wangu kumwao,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2CO 6:16">na kukala nao.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2CO 6:16">Nokwiza kua Mulungu wao,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2CO 6:16">nao wokwiza kua wanhu wangu.”<verse eid="2CO 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 6:17" />Mndewa kolonga ivija,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2CO 6:17">“Segeleni mmwao</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2CO 6:17">muinege nao,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2CO 6:17">sekemwamhe chinhu chilongigwe mwiko</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2CO 6:17">na niye nowabokeleni.<verse eid="2CO 6:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 6:18" />Niye nokwiza kua Tata yenu na mweye mokua wanangu wa wachike kwa walume, nie Mndewa nili na udaho nolonga.”<verse eid="2CO 6:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="2CO 7" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 7:1" />Baho, mweye mlina wende na niye, chahawa ching'higwa miyadi ino yose, chiinege na chinhu chochose chilonda kichitende muhe na ng'huli zetu, zileke kutogoligwa na Mulungu, chiwe wanhu wa Mulungu kabisa na kukala kwa kumfugamila Mulungu.<verse eid="2CO 7:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Deng'o da Paulo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 7:2" />Chompulani mching'he nyafasi mmoyo! Hachimtendele gehile munhu yoyose, hachina mulumiza hebu kumvwizila munhu yoyose. <verse eid="2CO 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 7:3" />Sizilonga mbuli zino kwa kumlamula munhu, kwavija kama vinikomeleze kulonga, mweye mwa mmoyo mwetu, chife hamwe hebu chikale hamwe. <verse eid="2CO 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 7:4" />Nomtumanilani ng'hani na noigodela ng'hani mweye! Mmadununzo getu mhata utindiwala mkulu na kudeng'helela ng'hani.<verse eid="2CO 7:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 7:5" />Hata vichivikile Makedonia hachihumule. Chila ubanzi kukala na madununzo, kunze choting'hanila ndwagi na mgati china gudemo. <verse eid="2CO 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 7:6" />Mbali Mulungu iyo yowagela moyo waja walekile kugendelela, na kwa kwiza kwake Tito na cheye kachigela moyo. <verse eid="2CO 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 7:7" />Si tu kwa kwiza kwake Tito, ila kwavija vumumgelile moyo mweye ivija. Nayo kachilongela vija vumlonda kuniona, vija vumli na giogio, na vumlonda kunigombela. Mbuli ino yoning'ha ndeng'helelo ng'hani.<verse eid="2CO 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 7:8" />Hata yahawa kwa balua yangu ija iwagela giogio, habule chinhu cha kunhenda nilumile. Enaa, noona kua balua iyo iwagela giogio mbali kwa chipindi chiguhi tu. <verse eid="2CO 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 7:9" />Sambi nodeng'helela, sio kwa vija mgwa giogio, ila kwa vija giogio jenu diwatenda muhinduke na mgalonge malozo genu na kugaleka. Mgeligwa giogio kwavija viyalondile Mulungu, na kwambuli iyo mweye hachiwalumize kwa mbuli yoyose. <verse eid="2CO 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 7:10" />Kuwa na giogio kama viyolonda Mulungu, kokutenda kuhinduka moyo na kuhinduka uko kotenda wanhu waleke malozo na kugala ulohozi, baho habule mbuli ya kulumila mmoyo. Mbali giogio da muuisi jogala ifa. <verse eid="2CO 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 7:11" />Sambi modaha kuona malawilo ganogile ga kukala na giogio kama Mulungu viyolonda. Mweye sambi mpata kua wanhu wa kuiyoha na mli na mbuli ya kulonga kua mwabule ubananzi, kua na ludoko na ubananzi na kumtegeleza Mulungu, na kuiyoha na kuona kua gamlondeka kutendeligwa gotendeka. Mweye muilagusa kwa nzila zose kua mwabule da kulamuligwa.<verse eid="2CO 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 7:12" />Hata yahawa nyandika balua ija, si kwa mbuli ija yabanange, hebu ya ija yabanangiligwe. Nyandika ili ioneke hazelu haulongozi ha Mulungu vija vumuiyoha kwambuli yetu. <verse eid="2CO 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 7:13" />Iyo mana cheye chikala chideng'helela ng'hani. Sio kua chideng'hela tu, ila ivija Tito kachitenda chideng'hele kwa dija deng'o jake diyakalile najo kwavija vumumsamhuse moyo! <verse eid="2CO 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 7:14" />Niye niweng'ha nhogolwa ng'hani haulongozi wake, na kwa muimbuli iyo hamnigelile chinyala. Chiwalongeleni kweli mazua gose, na vija vichiweng'ile nhogolwa haulongozi ha Tito iyo ikala mbuli ya ukweli yeka. <verse eid="2CO 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 7:15" />Kwaivo wende wake wa moyo kumwenu mweye wokongezeka ng'hani, chila viyokumbuka vija mweye wose vumuitandile kutegeleza, na vija vumumbokele kwa kudumba ng'hani na kugudema. <verse eid="2CO 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 7:16" />Nodeng'helela ng'hani kua nodaha kuwatumanila mweye ng'hani mchila mbuli.<verse eid="2CO 7:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="2CO 8" />
  <para style="s">Kuing'ha nying'ha Kikilisito</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 8:1" />Mbwiga zetu, cholonda kuwalongela mbuli ya unovu uja Mulungu yaulavile mmabumbila ga wamtogole Kilisito wa uko Makedonia. <verse eid="2CO 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 8:2" />Wamtogole Kilisito wa uko wagezigwa ng'hani kwa madununzo, mbali deng'o jao dikala kulu mbaka wakala wailava kubitiliza, ingawa wakala vikumbi muyega ng'hani. <verse eid="2CO 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 8:3" />Nodaha kulongelela kweli kua wakala na nying'ha kama ludabwa lwao vuwili na kubitiliza. Kwa vija viwalondile wenyego,<verse eid="2CO 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 8:4" />wachipula ng'hani kua weng'higwe nyafasi ya kwingila muisang'hano ya kuwataza wanhu wa Mulungu uko Yelusalemu. <verse eid="2CO 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 8:5" />Iyo ikala mbuli hachiitumanile kabisa! Mosi wailava wao wenyego kwa wenyego kwa Mndewa, amala wailava wenyego na kumwetu ivija kwa nzila ya wende wa Mulungu. <verse eid="2CO 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 8:6" />Kwambuli iyo chimpula Tito yaisongile mbuli iyo yawataze ili muisang'hane sang'hano ino ya wende mmwenu ivija. <verse eid="2CO 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 8:7" />Mweye muna chila chinhu, kumtogola Mulungu, ugalu wa kulonga, umanyi, udahi wose kutenda ganogile, na wende wenu kumwetu. Kwaivo, chotamanila muwe na nying'ha muisang'hano ino ya wende. <verse eid="2CO 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 8:8" />Niye simwing'hani mweye ndagizi, mbali nolonda tu kulagusa vija wamwenga viwogangamala kwa mbuli ya kutaza ili mhate kuvimanya vija wende wenu vuuli wa kweli. <verse eid="2CO 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 8:9" />Mweye moumanya unovu wa Mndewa wetu Yesu Kilisito, iyo hata yahawa kakala na chila chinhu, ila kaitenda chikumbi muyega kwa mbuli yenu, ili kwa uchikumbi muyega wake, yamwing'heni uzenzi.<verse eid="2CO 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 8:10" />Kwa mbuli ino baho, nomlongeleni kua yofaya kumwenu sambi kusang'hana gaja mgasongile mlao ubitile. Mweye mkala wa mosi kusonga kulonda kusang'hana ivo. <verse eid="2CO 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 8:11" />Baho, komelezeni mbuli iyo kama vuumkalile na moyo mkulu wa kutaza, baho sang'haneni kwa kuiyoha ivo kama vija vumdaha na kuikomeleza. <verse eid="2CO 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 8:12" />Hata yahawa hana munhu kana moyo wa kutaza, Mulungu kobokela chila chiyodaha kulava na halonda chimwenga. <verse eid="2CO 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 8:13" />Vinigesa hailondeka wamwenga watazigwe kuno mweye modununzika, mbali yolondeka hawe na ulinganyo. <verse eid="2CO 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 8:14" />Chija chimli nacho chongezeke, chiwataze waja walibule chinhu, ili nao chipindi vonda wawe na chinhu chongezeke wamtazeni mweye kwa vija vumulibule, na baho hawe na ulinganyo. <verse eid="2CO 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 8:15" />Kama Mayandiko ga Mulungu vigandikigwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2CO 8:15">“Yakunzanye vingi hawile na chongezeke,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2CO 8:15">na ija yakunzanye chidodo haungukiligwe.”<verse eid="2CO 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tito na wayage wotumigwa kuita uko Kolinto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 8:16" />Nomwing'ha hewela Mulungu yamwing'ile Tito moyo wa kutaza kama unilinao niye wa kumtazeni! <verse eid="2CO 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 8:17" />Sio tu katogola vichimpulile, ila kakala na moyo mkulu wa kutaza ivija, mbaka kalonda mwenyego kwiza kumwenu.<verse eid="2CO 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 8:18" />Baho chomlagiza munhu imwe hamwe nayo, nhogolwa zake za kuligula Usenga Unogile zenela mgamabumbila gose ga wamtogole Kilisito. <verse eid="2CO 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 8:19" />Na kubita gago, iyo kasaguligwa na mabumbila gose ga wamtogole Kilisito, yawe mietu muumwanza wakugala nhosa ino ya wende, muisang'hano chiitenda kwambuli ya ukulu wa Mndewa na kugangamiza kwa kugesa goya kwetu.<verse eid="2CO 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 8:20" />Cholonda kuinega na mbuli za kunung'hunikiligwa zija zonda kulawilila muuwimilizi wetu kwa mbuli ya nhosa ino ya nying'ha. <verse eid="2CO 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 8:21" />Vichigesa ni kusang'hana ganogile, si haulongozi ha Mndewa yaiyeka, mbali haulongozi ha wanhu ivija.<verse eid="2CO 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CO 8:22" />Baho, hamwe na ndugu wao, chimtuma ndugu yetu imwenga ija mala nyingi chimgeza mala nyingi, na chimuona kua kana moyo mkulu wa kutaza, hata sambi kana moyo ng'hani kwa vija viyomtogolani ng'hani mweye.<verse eid="2CO 8:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CO 8:23" />Tito iyo miangu, chosang'hana sang'hano hamwe kwambuli yenu, mbali kama hana munhu kolonda kumanya mbuli ya wano mbwiga zetu wamwenga, wokwiza hamwe nayo, wao ni wasenga wa mabumbila ga wamtogole Kilisito, nao womwing'ha nhogolwa Kilisito. <verse eid="2CO 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CO 8:24" />Baho walagusileni ukweli wa wende wenu, mabumbila ga wamtogole Kilisito wadahe kuona kweli kua chiniigodela kumwenu chofaya.<verse eid="2CO 8:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="2CO 9" />
  <para style="s">Kuwataza wamtogole Kilisito weli Yelusalemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 9:1" />Baho si lazima niye kwandika mbuli ya kutaza sang'hano yenu ino kwambuli ya wanhu wa Mulungu wa uko Yelusalemu. <verse eid="2CO 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 9:2" />Nowamanya vija vumli na moyo wa kutaza, na niigodela mweye kwa mbuli iyo haulongozi ha wanhu wa Makedonia. Niwalongela, “Mbwiga zetu wa Akaya wamala kuitanda kuchitaza kulawa mlao ubitile.” Kwaivo kuiyoha kwenu kumala kuswangiza wanhu wengi ng'hani. <verse eid="2CO 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 9:3" />Baho niwalagiza bwiga zetu kina Tito na wao wamwenga waidi, ili kuigoda kwetu kwambuli yenu kuoneke sio mbuli ziiyeka, na kua muitanda goya kabisa na kutaza kwenu kama vinilongile.<verse eid="2CO 9:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 9:4" />Seke iwe kua wanhu wa Makedonia waheza hamwe na niye chowavika hamna itanda, baho cheye chopata chinyala, bila kuchilonga chinyala chonda mchipate mweye wenyego, kwa vija chokua chiwatumanile kubita chiasi. <verse eid="2CO 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 9:5" />Kwaivo, niona yolondeka kuwapula mbwiga wano wachilongolele kwiza kumwenu, wapate kwika goya dija gweko jenu kulu mdilalike, najo dilaguse kweli kua ni gweko mdilavile mweye wenyego bila kuswangizigwa.<verse eid="2CO 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 9:6" />Sekemuisemwe, yohanda mbeyu ndodo kogobola hadodo, yohanda mbeyu nyingi kogobola hakulu. <verse eid="2CO 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 9:7" />Chila munhu baho, na yalave kama viyalonda mwenyego, mmoyo na wala sio kwa ugila hebu kwa kuswangizigwa, kwavija Mulungu komwing'ha wende ija yolava kwa deng'o. <verse eid="2CO 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 9:8" />Mulungu kodaha kumwing'hani mweye vingi kubita vija vumlonda, mmazua gose mweye mpate chila chinhu chimlonda, na baho mgendelele kutaza mui kila sang'hano inogile. <verse eid="2CO 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 9:9" />Kama Mayandiko ga Mulungu vigandikigwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2CO 9:9">“Nayo hulava kwa nying'ha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2CO 9:9">huweng'ha vikumbi muyega, utogoligwa wake ukale mazua gose galibule uhelelo.”<verse eid="2CO 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 9:10" />Mulungu iyo yomwing'ha mlimi mbeyu ya kuhanda na ndia ya kuja. Komwing'hani ivija mbeyu zimlonda, kozitenda zote na zikule, na kuwatenda mgobole ng'hani kwa nying'ha yenu. <verse eid="2CO 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 9:11" />Iyo komwing'hani uzenzi mkulu wa chila chinhu mmazua gose ili mweye mpate kumwing'ha hewela Mulungu kwambuli ya gweko jenu wadibokele kulawa kumwetu. <verse eid="2CO 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 9:12" />Yokua ivo, kwavija sang'hano ino ya Mulungu imuisang'hana sio kua yotaza vinhu vilondeka kwa mbuli ya wanhu wa Mulungu waiyeka, bali ivija yowatenda wanhu wengi wamwing'he hewela Mulungu. <verse eid="2CO 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 9:13" />Kwambuli ya kuilonga ija kweli na kulagusa sang'hano yetu ino, wanhu womfugamila Mulungu kwa vija vumsang'hane vinogile Usenga Unogile kwambuli ya Kilisito na vumuufugamile, na ivija kwa mbuli ya nying'ha muweng'ile wao na wamwenga wose.<verse eid="2CO 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 9:14" />Kwaivo wowapulileni mweye kwa moyo, kwambuli ya unovu uiyeka uja mwing'higwe na Mulungu. <verse eid="2CO 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 9:15" />Chomwing'ha hewela Mulungu kwa mbuli ya gweko jake dilibule ulinganyi!<verse eid="2CO 9:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="2CO 10" />
  <para style="s">Paulo koigombela sang'hano yake</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 10:1" />Niye Paulo mwenyego ija nooneka kua muhole nihawa hamwe na mweye, mbali mkali nahawa kutali na mweye. Ila nie nomfugamileni mavindi na unovu wake Kilisito. <verse eid="2CO 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 10:2" />Nompulani sekemnhende niwe na ludoko haja niheza, kwavija novimanya kua nodaha kua na ludoko kwa wose waja wochigesa kua chokala kama viwokala wanhu wa muuisi. <verse eid="2CO 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 10:3" />Kweli chokala muuisi, mbali hachiitoa bung'hukila kama viwaitoa wanhu wa muuisi. <verse eid="2CO 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 10:4" />Kwavija migoha ichitumila mzibung'hukila sio migoha ya muuisi, ila ni udaho wa Mulungu uja wobananga ng'huta ng'hulu zose, chozibananga nhonga zose za uvwizi, <verse eid="2CO 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 10:5" />na kubomola chila ngwamo ya magoda chikingwe kwambuli ya kuulema umanyi wa Mulungu, chozisola nhonga zao za ubananzi na kuwafunda wamtegeleze Kilisito. <verse eid="2CO 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 10:6" />Mwahategeleza kama viilondeka na Kilisito, cheye chowatoa waja hawategeleze.<verse eid="2CO 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 10:7" />Mloleni munhu kwa zija mbuli zimuona kwa meso genu kumwake. Ivo, hana munhu yoyose yogesa kua iyo wa Kilisito? Ena, baho yagese kua na cheye ivija ni wa Kilisito kama iyo viyeli wa Kilisito. <verse eid="2CO 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 10:8" />Hata yahawa niigoda kubitiliza kwa ija mbuli ya udaho yaching'ile, udaho wa kuwadahiza wanhu na sio kuwabananga, hata ivo siona chinyala hata chidogo. <verse eid="2CO 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 10:9" />Silonda mtonge kua nonda niwatende mdumbe kwa balua zangu. <verse eid="2CO 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 10:10" />Munhu kodaha kulonga, “Balua za Paulo za ludoko na ivija ndala, mbali iyo mwenyego yahawa hamwe na cheye ni munhu muhole, hata yahalonga mbuli zake zokua kama si chinhu.” <verse eid="2CO 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 10:11" />Munhu yolonga ivo kolondeka yakumbuke kua habule tafauti kwa gaja gachandika muibalua haja chahawa kutali, na gaja gondachigasang'hane chahawa na mweye.<verse eid="2CO 10:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 10:12" />Kwa vovose hachilonda kuitenda hebu kuilinga na waja wanhu woing'ha nhogolwa wenyego. Wanhu woitenda kua wao iyo chipimo cha kuipimila hebu wanhu woilinga wenyego kwa wenyego, ni wabozi! <verse eid="2CO 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 10:13" />Mbali cheye hachiikunga kubita chiasi, kuikunga uko kosigala mja mchipimo cha sang'hano iyaching'ile Mulungu, sang'hano ija choisang'hana kumwenu ivija. <verse eid="2CO 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 10:14" />Cheye hachibitilize kusang'hana gaja gachikiligwe haja vichizile kumwenu. Cheye iyo chilongole kwiza kumwenu kuwagalileni Usenga Unogile kwa mbuli ya Kilisito. <verse eid="2CO 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 10:15" />Baho, cheye hachiikunga kwa kubitiliza kwambuli ya sang'hano ziwasang'hane wanhu wamwenga, mbali chotumanila kua kutogola kwenu Mulungu kokongezeka, na sang'hano yetu kumwenu yokua ng'hulu kwa kuwinza goyolonda Mulungu. <verse eid="2CO 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 10:16" />Baho chodaha kuligula Usenga Unogile mziisi zimwenga, mbali na mweye sekeiwe mbuli ya kuikunga kwa sang'hano ziwatendile wanhu wamwenga hanhu hamwenga.<verse eid="2CO 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 10:17" />Mbali kama Mayandiko vigandikwe, “Munhu yoikunga, kolondeka yaikunge kwa sang'hano ya Mndewa.” <verse eid="2CO 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 10:18" />Yotogoligwa si ija munhu yoing'ha nhogolwa mwenyego, ila ija yokwing'higwa nhogolwa na Mndewa.<verse eid="2CO 10:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="2CO 11" />
  <para style="s">Paulo na wasenga wa uvwizi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 11:1" />Maza mwahafunyile moyo chidogo, hata yahawa niye na mbozi chidogo! Enaa, nifunyileni moyo chidogo. <verse eid="2CO 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 11:2" />Nowagesani ng'hani mweye, kama Mulungu viyowagesa, kwavija mweye mhambe safi mposigwe kwambuli ya mulume imwe tu iyo ija Kilisito. <verse eid="2CO 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 11:3" />Mbali nodumba kua, kama vija nyoka kwa ubala wake wa uvwizi, kamvwizila Hawa, ivo nhonga zenu zodaha kwagizigwa, na kuulema utogoligwa wenu wa kweli kwa Kilisito. <verse eid="2CO 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 11:4" />Kwavija munhu yoyose yokwiza na kumligula Yesu ija hailingile na ija chimligule cheye, mweye mombokela kwa mikono midi, hebu motogola Muhe hebu usenga tafauti kabisa na uja muubokele kulawa kumwetu!<verse eid="2CO 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 11:5" />Siigesa kama niye iyo mdodo kubita wao, “Wasenga wakulu“ <verse eid="2CO 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 11:6" />Yodahika nabule ulonzi ugoloke, mbali nili na umanyi, mbuli ino chiilagusa hazelu kumwenu, chila hanhu na chila chipindi.<verse eid="2CO 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 11:7" />Niye niligula Usenga Unogile wa Mulungu bila kulonda chitumetume, nikala muhole ili mhate kuwenula mweye. Ivo, nhenda vihile? <verse eid="2CO 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 11:8" />Vinisang'hane sang'hano mmwenu, ganilonda kusang'haniligwa gasang'haniligwa na mabumbila gamwenga ga wamtogole Kilisito. Kwa mbuli imwenga nikala kama niwaboka uzenzi wao mhate kuwatumikila mweye. <verse eid="2CO 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 11:9" />Vinikalile na mweye, simgazile munhu yoyose vija vinilondile sente, wamtogole Kilisito wayenu kulawa Makedonia wanigalila chila chinhu chinilondile. Nilola goya ng'hani ili sekeniwe sekeniwatumanile wanhu kwa vovose vija, na nogendelela kutenda ivo. <verse eid="2CO 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 11:10" />Habule munhu hata imwe mui isi ya Akaya, yonda yanikimile seke niikunge kwa mbuli iyo. Nolonga ivo kwavija ukweli wa Kilisito wa mgati yangu. <verse eid="2CO 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 11:11" />Habali nolonga ivo? Kwavija eti nabule wende na mweye? Mulungu kovimanya kua nina wende na mweye!<verse eid="2CO 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 11:12" />Nogendelela kusang'hana kama vinisang'hana sambi, ili seke niweng'he nyafasi waja wozambwila nyafasi, nyafasi ya kuikunga kua wosang'hana sang'hano kama vichisang'hana cheye. <verse eid="2CO 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 11:13" />Wanhu wao ni wasenga wa uvwizi, watenda sang'hano za uvwizi waja woivwizila kua wasenga wa kweli wa Kilisito. <verse eid="2CO 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 11:14" />Baho sekemkanganye, kwa vija hata Mwenembago nayo koivwizila mwenyego kua iyo mtumigwa wa kwa Mulungu wa bung'hulo! <verse eid="2CO 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 11:15" />Kwaivo, si mbuli ya kukanganya yahawa na wao watumigwa wake woivwizila kua watumigwa wa kutogoligwa na Mulungu. Muukomelezo wao wobokela chija chiolondeka kuilinga na mbuli zao.<verse eid="2CO 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Madununzo ga Paulo kama Msenga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 11:16" />Kaidi nolonga, munhu sekeyanigese kua niye mbozi. Mbali kama motonga ivo, baho nhendeni kama mbozi ili na niye mhate cha kuikunga hata chidogo. <verse eid="2CO 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 11:17" />Chinilonga sambi si chija chiyanilagize Mndewa, kwa mbuli ino ya kuikunga, nolonga tu kama munhu mbozi na halonda kuvimanya. <verse eid="2CO 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 11:18" />Wanhu wengi woikunga kwambuli za Muiisi, na niye ivija noikunga. <verse eid="2CO 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 11:19" />Mweye mna nzewele, lekaivo mowafunyila moyo hata wabozi na waja hawalonda kuvimanya! <verse eid="2CO 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 11:20" />Momfunyila moyo hata munhu yomtendani mweye watumwa, munhu yombokani, ija yomnyonyani, ija yowazeleu na yowazabula mchihanga. <verse eid="2CO 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 11:21" />Kwa chinyala notogola kua cheye chikala na uzidilwa wa kusang'hana mbuli izo!</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CO 11:21">Mbali kama hana munhu yoyose yodaha kuikunga kwa chinhu nolonga kama mbozi, niye noikunga ivija. <verse eid="2CO 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CO 11:22" />Ivo, wao ni Waebulania? Hata niye ivija. Ivo, wao ni Waizilaeli? Hata niye ivija. Wao ni ulelo wa Ibulahimu? Hata niye ivija. <verse eid="2CO 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CO 11:23" />Wao ni watumigwa wa Kilisito? Hata niye ivija, nolonga gago kama chichala, niye ni mtumigwa wa Kilisito kubita wao. Niye nisang'hana sang'hano ndala ng'hani, nikala mdigeleza mala nyingi ng'hani, nitoigwa mala nyingi ng'hani na mala nyingi nikala behi na ifa kubita wao. <verse eid="2CO 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CO 11:24" />Mala tano nitoigwa na Wayahudi zija mbalati salasini na tisa, <verse eid="2CO 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2CO 11:25" />nitoigwa mbalati mala nhatu na Walumi, nitoigwa mabwe mala imwe, mala nhatu nibenekiligwa meli muibahali, na umo niwasa meso chilo yose na kusinda misi yose mmazi.<verse eid="2CO 11:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2CO 11:26" />Mmiyanza yangu mingi mhatigwa na bung'hukila ya mazi ya lwanda na bung'hukila za wanyama na bung'hukila kulawa kwa wayangu muiisi na kulawa kwa wanhu wa isi zimwenga na bung'hukila za mzikae na bung'hukila kulawa kwa mbwiga wa uvwizi. <verse eid="2CO 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2CO 11:27" />Nisang'hanika kwa kudununzika, mala nyingi niwasa meso, nikala na nzala na ng'ilu, mala nyingi nisinda nzala na kukala muimbeho bila chivalo. <verse eid="2CO 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2CO 11:28" />Mbali ya mbuli zimwenga nyingi, mazua gose ng'hala notonga sang'hano za mabumbila gose ga wamtogole Kilisito. <verse eid="2CO 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2CO 11:29" />Kama munhu yoyose ni mzidilwa, na niye ivija mzidilwa, munhu yoyose yahatendigwa kutenda malozo, na niye ivija nogwa ludoko.<verse eid="2CO 11:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2CO 11:30" />Nihalondeka kuikunga, baho noikunga kwa uzidilwa wangu. <verse eid="2CO 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2CO 11:31" />Mulungu na Tata wa Mndewa Yesu, ija yolondeka kwing'higwa nhogolwa bila uhelelo, nayo kovimanya kua sivwiza. <verse eid="2CO 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2CO 11:32" />Ving'halile Damasiko, mkulu wa kae, yakalile yomtaza mfaume Aleta, na kakala keka wamilizi muikae iyo ili yanigele mmakono. <verse eid="2CO 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2CO 11:33" />Mbali, nimkimbila kwa kutelemsigwa kunze kubitila mgelo mkulu mdizonzo da nhuta.<verse eid="2CO 11:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="2CO 12" />
  <para style="s">Paulo koona ulolesi na ugubulo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 12:1" />Baho, noikunga hata yahawa haifaya! Mbali sambi noilonga mbuli ya ulolesi na ugubulo yanilagusile Mndewa. <verse eid="2CO 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 12:2" />Nommanya munhu imwe mtogola Kilisito, mmilao kumi na mine ibitile viyanyamuligwe mbaka kuulanga kuchanha ng'hani. Sivimanyile kama kakala uko kilukuli hebu kwa muhe, Mulungu kovimanya. <verse eid="2CO 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 12:3" />Nobwelela, novimanya kua munhu ino kanyamuligwa mbaka kuulanga kwa Mulungu, mbali sivimanya kama kakala uko kilukuli hebu ki muhe, Mulungu kovimanya. <verse eid="2CO 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 12:4" />Uko kahulika mbuli zija ndala kuzilongelela zija hata munhu halondeka kuzilonga. <verse eid="2CO 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 12:5" />Baho, noikunga kwa munhu kama ino, na si kwambuli yangu niye mwenyego, mbali tu kwambuli ya uzidilwa wangu. <verse eid="2CO 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 12:6" />Mbali kama nihalondile kuikunga, sekeniwe mbozi hata chidogo, kwavija nahalongile kweli yeka. Mbali siikunga, silonda munhu yanitonge ng'hani kubita vija viyaniona na kuhulika kulawa kumwangu.<verse eid="2CO 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 12:7" />Mbali, mbuli zino ng'hulu inilagusigwe sekezinhende niikunga ng'hani, ivo ning'higwa madununzo mlukuli kama mwiwa, msenga wa Mwenembago ija yonitoa niye sekeniikunge kubitiliza. <verse eid="2CO 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 12:8" />Nimpula ng'hani Mndewa mala nhatu ili mbuli ino inilawe. <verse eid="2CO 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 12:9" />Mbali kanilongela,“Unovu wangu wokwenela kwa mbuli yako, kwavija udaho wangu wooneka muuzidilwa.” Baho vinoga ng'hani kuikunga uzidilwa wangu ili udaho wake Kilisito ukale kumwangu. <verse eid="2CO 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 12:10" />Kwaivo notogola kwa mbuli ya uzidilwa na zeleu na udala na uonezi na madununzo, kwambuli ya Kilisito. Kwavija nihawa mzidilwa, ivo nokua na ludabwa.<verse eid="2CO 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulo kana kitwetwetwe kwa Wakolinto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 12:11" />Nikala kama mbozi, mbali mweye iyo mniswangize niwe ivo. Mweye iyo mlondeka kuning'ha nhogolwa. Hata yahawa niye si chinhu, kwa vovose, niye si mdodo kubita wao “Wasenga wakulu.” <verse eid="2CO 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 12:12" />Vinikalile kumwenu nie nikala nofunyamoyo, na kusang'hana miujiza na uzonza ilagusa kua nie na msenga wa Mulungu. <verse eid="2CO 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 12:13" />Ivo, mhungukiligwa choni ng'hani kubita mabumbila gamwenga ga wamtogole Kilisito? Ivo, niye kwa ubanzi wangu siwatendile mgae kupata cha kunitaza? Yahawa nibananga kusang'hana ivo, nompulani nisameheni!<verse eid="2CO 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 12:14" />Sambi, nodaha kwiza kumwenu mala ya nhatu na simgazani. Chinizambwila kumwenu si vinhu venu bali mweye wenyego. Ni mazoela ga tata na mama kuwekila wana wao usigavu, mbali si wana kuwekila usigavu tata na mama zao. <verse eid="2CO 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 12:15" />Niye nhogola kutumila chinili nacho, na hata kuilava kabisa niye mwenyego, kwambuli ya muhe zenu. Ivo, moning'ha wende chidogo kwavija niye nomwing'hani wende ng'hani?<verse eid="2CO 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 12:16" />Baho, motogola kua niye siwile mzidilwa kumwenu. Mbali munhu imwenga kodaha kulonga kua, “Kwa vija Paulo ni mbala kawavwizileni.” <verse eid="2CO 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 12:17" />Ivo, niye nimnyonyani chochose kubitila msenga yoyose nimtumile kumwenu? <verse eid="2CO 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 12:18" />Niye nimpula Tito, nimlagiza kumwenu hamwe na mbwiga yetu imwenga. Ivo, chimyonyani Tito kamnyonyani chochose mmwenu? Ivo, hamvimanya kua cheye chikala chilongozigwe na muhe iija, na chosang'hana hamwe?<verse eid="2CO 12:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 12:19" />Motonga kua mbaka sambi cheye choigombela hamwenu! Ila chozilonga mbuli zino haulongozi ha Mulungu, kuno chiilumba na Kilisito. Mbuli zino zose mbwiga zangu, ni kwambuli ya kuwagangamizeni mweye. <verse eid="2CO 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 12:20" />Nodumba, hengine vonda nize kumwenu nomvikani hamwili na vija vinilondile niwavike, na mweye hamniona kama vimlonda kuniona. Nodumba hengine hokua na kugomba na maya na kuihasanya na kuibishila na kuilonga na kunyong'onya na kuikunga na ndwagi hamwenu. <verse eid="2CO 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 12:21" />Nodumba kwa vija baho naheza mwanza umwenga Mulungu konhenda niwe muhole kumwenu, na niye nokwiza kuwalilila wengi waja watendile malozo mbali hawalondile kuleka malozo, wang'hali wotenda maya zihile za luhadu na ugoni.<verse eid="2CO 12:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="2CO 13" />
  <para style="s">Paulo kokomeleza kuwalakila na kuwalaga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 13:1" />Ino iyo mala yangu ya kadatu kwiza kumwenu. Mayandiko gandikigwa, “Chila mbuli yolamuligwa kwa ulonzi wa wanhu waidi hebu wadatu waonile.” <verse eid="2CO 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 13:2" />Nimala kulonga, na kama viiwile muumwanza wa kaidi, sambi nolonga kaidi nihawa kutali, vondanize siwaonela bazi waja wose watendile ubananzi mbali hawalondile kugalonga na kugaleka malozo gao na kumhindukila Mulungu, na ivija kwa waja wamwenga. <verse eid="2CO 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 13:3" />Moionela wenyego kua Kilisito kolonga mgati yangu. Kumwenu Kilisito si mzidilwa, baho udaho wake wosang'hanika hagati yenu. <verse eid="2CO 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 13:4" />Kwavija hata yahawa kawambigwa muumsalaba kwambuli ya uzidilwa, mbali sambi kana ugima kwa udaho wa Mulungu. Cheye ivija kwa uzidilwa choilumba nayo mbali chokala kwa udaho wa Mulungu.<verse eid="2CO 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 13:5" />Muilole goya mweye wenyego mpate kuvimanya kama kweli momtogola Mulungu. Muilole mweye wenyego. Ivo, hamvimanya kua Kilisito Yesu kamgati yenu? Kama sio, baho mweye mpotigwa.<verse eid="2CO 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 13:6" />Mbali notumanila kua mweye movimanya kua cheye hachipotigwe.<verse eid="2CO 13:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 13:7" />Chompula Mulungu sekemtende ubananzi wowose, mbali si kwambuli ya kuoneka kama wanhu wamalile kuhuma, hata yahawa cheye chooneka chipotigwa. <verse eid="2CO 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 13:8" />Kwavija hachidaha kuulema ukweli, ila udaho chili nao wa kugendelela na ukweli. <verse eid="2CO 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 13:9" />Chodeng'helela kua cheye ni wazidilwa, mbali mweye mna udaho, ivo chompulani mkale kwa kutogoligwa kwa chila chinhu. <verse eid="2CO 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 13:10" />Baho, nokwandika balua ino nihawa kutali, ili vondanivike kumwenu, sekeniwe na ludoko kumwenu kwa kutumila uja udaho yaning'ile Mndewa. Mndewa kaning'ha udaho wa kuwatenda mgangamale na wala si wa kubomola.<verse eid="2CO 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 13:11" />Mbwiga zangu, sambi niye nokomeleza kwa kumlagani! Mukale kwa kugangamala, gogeni ganilonga, mgese dimwe, kaleni kwa utindiwala. Nayo Mulungu yeli na wende na utindiwala kokala hamwe na mweye.<verse eid="2CO 13:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 13:12" />Ilamuseni kwa kulagusa wende wa Kilisito. <verse eid="2CO 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 13:13" />Wanhu wose wa Mulungu weli kuno wowalamuseni.<verse eid="2CO 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 13:14" />Unovu wa Mndewa Yesu Kilisito na wende wa Mulungu hamwe na Muhe wa Mulungu, vikale na mweye mose.<verse eid="2CO 13:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 13" />
</usx>